{"seq":3,"slug":"freight-cost-allocation-payment-recon","title":"运费分摊归集与付款对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/freight-bill-audit-payment/freight-cost-allocation-payment-recon","wordCount":1893,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"运费分摊归集与付款对账\">运费分摊归集与付款对账</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>审计决定了&quot;应付多少&quot;，付款决定了&quot;实付多少&quot;，而这两者之间的差需要在账上有一个解释。这就是运费分摊归集与付款对账要解决的问题：把一笔笔运费落到它该承担的对象上（订单、商品、成本中心），并让&quot;应付—实付—已分摊&quot;三个数在任意时点都能互相推导出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分摊的三个前置问题\">分摊的三个前置问题</h2><p>在做分摊算法之前，必须先回答三个问题，它们的答案决定了分摊口径，而口径一旦定下来就不能随意变更——因为 landed cost 会被下游的清仓决策、毛利核算与税务申报共同使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分摊对象是什么\">分摊对象是什么</h3><p>运费该落到哪个对象上，取决于用它做什么：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分摊对象</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>粒度要求</th>\n<th>常见数据源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单</td>\n<td>客户侧毛利、运费补贴决策</td>\n<td>订单级</td>\n<td>订单-发货单关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品/SKU</td>\n<td>landed cost、定价与清仓</td>\n<td>SKU 级</td>\n<td>发货明细</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本中心/事业部</td>\n<td>预算与绩效核算</td>\n<td>组织级</td>\n<td>组织归属</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户/渠道</td>\n<td>渠道盈利分析</td>\n<td>渠道级</td>\n<td>渠道标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存批次</td>\n<td>存货计价</td>\n<td>批次级</td>\n<td>批次跟踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分摊到哪一层\">分摊到哪一层</h3><p>一票运费往往对应<strong>多个订单</strong>（合单发货）或<strong>一个订单的多个商品</strong>，因此分摊必须在一个<strong>聚合边界</strong>内完成。边界的选择很实际：如果按发货单分摊，一票运费就落在该发货单内的商品上，简单但可能把重货与轻货的成本摊平；如果按体积/重量分摊到 SKU，更准确但要求发货明细有可靠的尺寸重量数据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分摊基准\">分摊基准</h3><p>基准是分摊的核心参数，常见四种：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>share</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>金额</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>计费重量</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>体积</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>件数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{share}_i = \\frac{w_i}{\\sum_j w_j}, \\quad w_i \\in \\{\\text{金额}, \\text{计费重量}, \\text{体积}, \\text{件数}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">share</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2294em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">金额</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计费重量</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">体积</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基准</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按金额</td>\n<td>运费与货值相关（高价值货保价）</td>\n<td>数据易得</td>\n<td>与实际运输成本脱钩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按计费重量</td>\n<td>快递/零担/空运</td>\n<td>与成本强相关</td>\n<td>需准确的尺寸重量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按体积</td>\n<td>轻抛货、拼箱</td>\n<td>反映舱位占用</td>\n<td>重货被低估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按件数</td>\n<td>标准化小件</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>忽略尺寸差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>不要用&quot;平均分摊&quot;</strong>。平均分摊在管理上省事，但它会让高价商品看着便宜、低价商品看着亏，最终误导定价与清仓决策——而 landed cost 恰恰是这些决策的输入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分摊必须可复算\">分摊必须可复算</h3><p>分摊结果的正确性无法用&quot;看起来合理&quot;来判断，只能靠<strong>输入可追溯</strong>。一条分摊记录必须能回答：用了哪条运费记录、哪个基准、哪个比例、依据的哪一版规则。这要求分摊结果落表时带全这些字段，而不是只存一个最终金额。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分摊明细：每条运费 → 多个分摊目标，带基准与比例&#10;CREATE TABLE freight_alloc_line (&#10;  alloc_id        BIGINT       NOT NULL,&#10;  freight_line_id BIGINT       NOT NULL,   -- 指向认定的运费行（含审计调整后金额）&#10;  target_type     TEXT         NOT NULL,   -- order / sku / cost_center / batch&#10;  target_id       BIGINT       NOT NULL,&#10;  basis           TEXT         NOT NULL,   -- amount / billed_weight / volume / piece&#10;  basis_value     NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  basis_total     NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL,  -- 同一聚合边界内基准值合计&#10;  share_ratio     NUMERIC(12,8) NOT NULL,  -- basis_value / basis_total&#10;  allocated_amount NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL, -- 按币种&#10;  currency        CHAR(3)      NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_version    TEXT         NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (alloc_id, target_type, target_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分摊明细：每条运费 → 多个分摊目标，带基准与比例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> freight_alloc_line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  alloc_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  freight_line_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 指向认定的运费行（含审计调整后金额）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- order / sku / cost_center / batch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  basis           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- amount / billed_weight / volume / piece</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  basis_value     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  basis_total     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同一聚合边界内基准值合计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  share_ratio     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- basis_value / basis_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allocated_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按币种</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (alloc_id, target_type, target_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>basis_total</code> 与 <code>share_ratio</code> 冗余存储是刻意的：它们让任何一条分摊记录都能被独立验证（<code>allocated_amount ≈ basis_value / basis_total × 运费金额</code>），不需要重新查询全表。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分摊守恒检查：分摊合计与运费金额的差异必须为零（含舍入）&#10;SELECT freight_line_id,&#10;       SUM(allocated_amount) AS allocated_sum,&#10;       MAX(freight_amount)   AS freight_amount,&#10;       SUM(allocated_amount) - MAX(freight_amount) AS residual&#10;FROM freight_alloc_line&#10;JOIN freight_line USING (freight_line_id)&#10;GROUP BY freight_line_id&#10;HAVING ABS(SUM(allocated_amount) - MAX(freight_amount)) &gt; 0.01;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分摊守恒检查：分摊合计与运费金额的差异必须为零（含舍入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freight_line_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(allocated_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> allocated_sum,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(freight_amount)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freight_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(allocated_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(freight_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> residual</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freight_alloc_line</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freight_line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (freight_line_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freight_line_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(allocated_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(freight_amount)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>分摊守恒是硬约束</strong>：分摊合计必须等于运费金额，差额只能来自舍入且不超过最小币种单位。不满足守恒的分摊记录必须报警，因为它意味着有成本被凭空创造或丢失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"币种与汇率-跨境分摊的隐藏难点\">币种与汇率：跨境分摊的隐藏难点</h2><p>跨境运费常以外币结算（USD 运费、CNY 入账），而分摊目标在国内账上。汇率选择的差异会直接把分摊结果推偏：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>汇率类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易日汇率</td>\n<td>运单产生日的汇率</td>\n<td>权责发生制核算</td>\n<td>与实际付款日不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算日汇率</td>\n<td>付款日的汇率</td>\n<td>现金核算</td>\n<td>期末未结部分无汇率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期末汇率</td>\n<td>报表期末汇率</td>\n<td>报表折算</td>\n<td>与实付差异挂账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>正确做法是分开记账</strong>：分摊用交易日汇率（还原当时的实际成本），付款差异用汇兑损益单独归集，不要把汇兑差额混进运费成本里——否则 landed cost 会包含汇率波动噪声，下个季度的清仓决策就建立在失真的成本上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"付款对账-三方勾稽\">付款对账：三方勾稽</h2><p>分摊解决&quot;落到哪&quot;，付款对账解决&quot;付了没、付对没&quot;。核心是三方勾稽：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[应付台账&lt;br/&gt;审计后的认定金额] --&gt; D{三方勾稽}&#10;  B[付款流水&lt;br/&gt;银行/支付网关实际支出] --&gt; D&#10;  C[分摊台账&lt;br/&gt;落到订单/SKU的金额] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt;|应付 = 实付| E[付款匹配]&#10;  D --&gt;|应付 ≠ 实付| F[差异分类]&#10;  F --&gt; G[未付/少付&lt;br/&gt;补付或转为争议]&#10;  F --&gt; H[多付&lt;br/&gt;追回或下期抵扣]&#10;  F --&gt; I[汇率差异&lt;br/&gt;归入汇兑损益]&#10;  E --&gt; J[期末结清]&#10;  G --&gt; J&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; K[汇兑损益科目]\">graph TD\n  A[应付台账&lt;br/&gt;审计后的认定金额] --&gt; D{三方勾稽}\n  B[付款流水&lt;br/&gt;银行/支付网关实际支出] --&gt; D\n  C[分摊台账&lt;br/&gt;落到订单/SKU的金额] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt;|应付 = 实付| E[付款匹配]\n  D --&gt;|应付 ≠ 实付| F[差异分类]\n  F --&gt; G[未付/少付&lt;br/&gt;补付或转为争议]\n  F --&gt; H[多付&lt;br/&gt;追回或下期抵扣]\n  F --&gt; I[汇率差异&lt;br/&gt;归入汇兑损益]\n  E --&gt; J[期末结清]\n  G --&gt; J\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; K[汇兑损益科目]</pre><h3 id=\"逐笔匹配与批次匹配\">逐笔匹配与批次匹配</h3><p>对账有两种粒度。<strong>逐笔匹配</strong>把每一笔付款对应到具体的应付记录，精确但要求承运商提供付款明细（很多承运商只给&quot;本账期总额&quot;）。<strong>批次匹配</strong>按账期总额核对，简单但无法定位差异来源。</p>\n<p>现实路径是<strong>先批次后逐笔</strong>：先做账期级的总额对账（发现总额不符立即报警），再对不符的账期做逐笔拆解。这个顺序能避免在总数就对不上的情况下投入大量精力做逐笔匹配。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预付款与押金\">预付款与押金</h3><p>不少承运商要求预存保证金或预付运费。这部分资金不能直接计入运费成本，而应作为<strong>预付款资产</strong>挂账，在实际运单产生时逐笔冲减。若直接计入成本，会出现&quot;付了钱但没走货&quot;的成本虚增，期末对账也失去意义。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对账的终态与挂账期限\">对账的终态与挂账期限</h3><p>对账不能无限期挂账。每条应付记录必须有明确的收敛路径：<code>matched</code>（已匹配结清）、<code>adjusted</code>（已通过抵扣/冲销处理）、<code>written_off</code>（超过挂账期限经批准核销）。<strong>写核销门槛</strong>很重要——它防止未结项无限累积，也迫使系统暴露长期对不上的承运商或流程问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与成本核算体系的衔接\">与成本核算体系的衔接</h2><p>分摊后的运费最终要进入存货成本或期间费用。会计准则层面，存货成本包含<strong>采购成本、转换成本以及使存货达到目前场所和状态所发生的其他成本</strong>（IAS 2 存货准则的存货成本构成，见 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-2-inventories/\">IFRS IAS 2 Inventories</a>）。这给出了一个判断依据：<strong>入库前的运输费用应计入存货成本，销售后的配送费用属期间费用</strong>。</p>\n<p>这个区分直接影响分摊设计：进货运费要按批次/批次内 SKU 分摊并随存货结转；销货运费按订单分摊并计入当期费用。两条链路的分摊基准与落库对象都不同，混在一起会让存货计价与毛利核算同时出错。这一区别也是本 hub 与 <a href=\"../procurement-performance/saving-measurement-should-cost\">采购节省度量与 should-cost</a> 的衔接点——节省额的口径必须说明它作用在哪条链路上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分摊前先定三件事：分摊对象（订单/SKU/成本中心/批次）、聚合边界、分摊基准；不要用平均分摊。</li>\n<li>分摊基准按品类特征选：快递/零空运按计费重量，轻抛货与拼箱按体积，标准化小件按件数。</li>\n<li>分摊守恒是硬约束：分摊合计必须等于运费金额，差额仅限舍入。</li>\n<li>跨境分摊用交易日汇率记录成本，汇兑差异单列损益，不混入运费成本。</li>\n<li>付款对账先批次后逐笔；预付款挂预付款资产逐笔冲减，不直接计成本。</li>\n<li>进货运费计入存货成本、销货运费计入期间费用，两条链路分开建模。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"运费分摊归集与付款对账","id":"运费分摊归集与付款对账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊的三个前置问题","id":"分摊的三个前置问题"},{"level":3,"text":"分摊对象是什么","id":"分摊对象是什么"},{"level":3,"text":"分摊到哪一层","id":"分摊到哪一层"},{"level":3,"text":"分摊基准","id":"分摊基准"},{"level":3,"text":"分摊必须可复算","id":"分摊必须可复算"},{"level":2,"text":"币种与汇率：跨境分摊的隐藏难点","id":"币种与汇率-跨境分摊的隐藏难点"},{"level":2,"text":"付款对账：三方勾稽","id":"付款对账-三方勾稽"},{"level":3,"text":"逐笔匹配与批次匹配","id":"逐笔匹配与批次匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"预付款与押金","id":"预付款与押金"},{"level":3,"text":"对账的终态与挂账期限","id":"对账的终态与挂账期限"},{"level":2,"text":"与成本核算体系的衔接","id":"与成本核算体系的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"重复/错误归类/超收识别与追偿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/freight-bill-audit-payment/duplicate-misclass-overcharge-recovery"},"next":{"title":"合同履约与 scorecard 联动（联121）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/procurement-performance/carrier-contract-scorecard-link"}}